<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 PE - Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">1Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba ra1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba Rokuthanga ridonyohwa na</para>
  <para style="mt1">PITA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba Rokuthanga raPita ridonyohwa noNhumwa Pita. Pita adothanga tsamba rache nokunyaira kuti iye mbani uye kuti mbani waadonyorera. Tsamba rache adorinangisa kumaKhirisitu vese vaadodaidza kuti “vatohwa” (1Pita 1:1, 1:17, na 2:11) Vaverengi vache anovadaidza achidaro kadowanda ndava vanga vadofararira munyika dzidosiyanasiyana. Nondava yokuti tsamba rakareri rinozvimwe zvidofanana notsamba raPhauro kuvaEfeso, vazinji vanotenda kuti 1Pita ridonyohwa mumasure mavaEfeso kumakore yokumakumi matanhatu nomashano musure mukuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. Pita adonyora tsamba iri kubva kuRoma kwaari kudaidza kuti Bhabhironi (1 Pita 5:13)</para>
  <para style="ip">Pita anoti adonyora tsamba iri nochinangwa chokuti, “ndikukurudzirei uye ndipfakaze kuti uyu mutsa waMwari wochokwadi” (1 Pita 5:12) Zviripo zvimwe zvidofanana pakati paPita wokuthanga 2:11—3:7, vaEfeso 5:18—6:9, navaKorose 3:18—4:6. Dzese ndima idzi dzitatu dzinoraira zvoukama hwomhuri nokuteerera vanomasimba. Anokurudzirawo maKhirisitu kutsungirira kana pava nokutambudzika nokuti kuguma kwava papfupi (1 Pita 4:1)</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Pita anozviwidzira nokunyaira kuvaverengi vache (1 Pita 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Wodzotenda Mwari nokuda kworuponiso ravanokovana vese uye kuti zvinorevei kuupenyu hwavo (1 Pita 1:3—2:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera huraira vatendi magariro yavangaite munyika achidzobata ukama hudosiyanasiyana hudoita sehwomurume nomukadzi uye muranda natenzi (1 Pita 2:11—4:11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure mozvakarezvo Pita anovakurudzira kuti vachiirire pakutambudzika (1Pita 4:12—5:11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Wodzovhara tsamba rache (1 Pita 5:12-14)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Kubva kuna Pita, nhumwa yaJesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Kuvatohwa vadokwamwarira kudzimwe nyika dzinoti, Pondasi, Garatiya, Kapadhokiya, Ezhiya nokuBhitiniya vari vasaruhwa vaMwari, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />maererano nokutemehwa naMwari Baba nokuchenesewa naMweya kuti vateerere Jesu Khirisitu nokuwazihwa kwogazi rache.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Dai mutsa norunyararo zvawanziwa kwamuri.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tariro Ipenyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Mbaakudziwe Mwari naBaba vaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu! Mutsitsi dzache dzikuru tidozvahwa patsva kutariro ipenyu kuburikidza nokumuka kwaJesu Khirisitu kubva kuvadopfa, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />nokunhaka isingapfuruke, yamudochengetehwa kudenga, isingasvipisiwe kana kuuna, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />iyemi kuburikidza nokutenda mudodzivirihwa nosimba raMwari nokuda kworuponiso ridogadzirihwa kuonesewa panguwa yokupedzisira.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Munozvakarezvi zvese munofara maninge, kana zvazvene kwonguwa ino ipfupi muchifanira kudzudziwa nomarudzi yese yomiyedzo. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Zvakarezvi zvidouya kuitira kuti pakuonekwa kwaJesu, kutenda kwenyu kunokosha kukunda ndarama, inoparara kana zvayene ichinatsiwa nomoto, kuwanike kuri kwochaiko kunofanira kuva nopembedzo, kubhwinya nokuremekedzewa. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Kana zvenyu musinai kumuona, munomuda, kana zvenyu musiri kumuona manje, munotenda kwaari uye mudozara nomufaro mukuru usingataurike, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />ndava muri kutambira zvinobva pakutenda kwenyu, iro ruponiso romweya yenyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Pamusoro poruponiso rakareri, vaporofiti vadonyaira zvomutsa waidzouya kwamuri, vadonatsa kutsvagitsitsa, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />vachibvunzitsitsa pamusoro pokuti munhui nonguwa idonangiwa noMweya waKirisitu waiva mavari pawainangidza kutambudzika kwaKhirisitu nokubhwinya kwaidzotevera. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Zvidozaruhwa kwavari kuti pavainyaira zvinhu zvakarezvi zvamudodzonyepewa naivo vadokuparidzirai vhangeri naMweya Mutsvene adotumiwa kubva kudenga, vaishumira imipa vasingazvishumire ivo, zviri zvinhu zvinodiwa kuonewa nongirozi.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudaidziwa Kudzorarama Muutsvene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Nokudaro gadzirirai pfungwa dzenyu, muve vadopepuka, isai tarisiro yenyu idozara pamutsa uchauya kwamuri pakuonekwa kwaJesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Sevana vanoteerera, rekai kuumbiwa nozvido zvidoipa zvokusaziva kwamaiva nako kare. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Asi saiye mutsvene adokudaidzai, ivaiwo vatsvene pamuitiro wenyu wese, <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />ndava kudonyohwa kuti, “Ivai vatsvene, ndava inipano ndiri mutsvene.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Sezvo wamunodaidza kuti Baba achitonga basa romunhu wese pasinai tsvete, raramai upenyu hwenyu sevatohwa muchicha. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ndava munoziva kuti hamunai kudzikinuhwa nozvinoparara zvinenge sirivha kana ndarama kubva munzira dzenyu dzisinai nomusoro wese dzamudosiihwa nomadzibaba yenyu, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />asi nogazi rinokosha raKhirisitu, kunge rohwayana risinai chinoshoreka kana dondorozi. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Iye adosarudziwa nyika isinati yasikiwa, asi adodzoonesewa panguwa dzino dzokupedzisira nondava yenyu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Kuburikidza naye mudotenda kuna Mwari, adomumutsa kubva kuvadopfa achimupasa kubhwinya, nokudaro kutenda kwenyu notariro zviri muna Mwari.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Zvino zvamudozvinatsa kuburikidza nokuteerera chokwadi kuti muve norudo rudoperera kuhama dzenyu, ditsitsanai zvinobva pamwoyo. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Mudoberekewa patsva, aikona nombeu inoora, asi noisingaore, kuburikidza noshoko raMwari ripenyu rinogara, <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />ndava,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Vanhu vese vanenge usva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">kubhwinya kwavo kwese kunenge ruva romusango.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Usva hunosvava, noruva rinokuhumuka,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />asi shoko raIshe rinogara nokusingapere.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Futi shoko rakareri ndiro nhau dzidonaka dzidoparidziwa kwamuri.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Ribwe Ripenyu noRudzi Ritsvene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Nokudaro biritsai mungu wese nokunyengedza kwese, nokunyepedzera, usvinu, nomarudzi yese yomakuhwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Sevacheche vachandozvariwa ditsitsai mukaka womweya udochena, kuti mukure nawo muruponiso renyu, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />ndava ikozvino mudoravidza kuti Ishe adonaka.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Uyai kwaari iye ribwe ripenyu, ridorambiwa novanhu asi pamberi paMwari ridosarudziwa futi rinokosha. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Naimipawo semabhwe mapenyu vakhiwai muchiva imba yomweya, muve boka rovapirisita vatsvene, mupereke zvibairo zvomweya zvinotambirika kuna Mwari kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />ndava mugwaro zvirimo zvinoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Nangarai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ndiri kuisa muZioni ribwe ropakhona ridosarudziwa futi rinokosha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">nouyo anotenda maari haanyadzisiwe.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Saka kwamuri imipa vanotenda, rinokosha, asi kuno avo vasingatende,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Ribwe rakarero ridorambiwa novavakhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ridodzova musoro wokhona,”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />futi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Ribwe rinoguhuna vanhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">riri dombo rinovambwedza.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Vanoguhuniwa ndava havatetekere shoko, sezvavadotemehwa kuita.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Asi imipa muri vanhu vadosarudziwa, vouphirisita hwoumambo, rudzi ritsvene, vanhu vache Mwari, kuti muparidze kurumbidziwa kwaiye adokudaidzai kubva murima kuenda muchiedza chache chinoshamisa. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Kare manga musiri vanhu, asi zvino mava vanhu vaMwari, kare manga musinai kunzvihwa tsitsi, asi zvino mudonzvihwa tsitsi.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Varanda vaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Vadikani, ndinokukumbiritsai, sevatohwa novarendo, siyanai nozvido zvonyama, zvinohwisana nomweya wenyu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Raramai upenyu hudonaka pakati povasingatende, kuti kana nepo vachikunenerai kuti munoita zvidoipa, vaone zviito zvenyu zvidonaka, varumbidze Mwari pazuva raachauya.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Zviisei pasi pomasimba yovanhu, nokuda kwaIshe, angave mambo, saiye anomasimba makuru, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />kana vatongi, vaadotuma iye kuti varange vanodzonga nokupembedza vanokohorora. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ndava nghuda kwaMwari kuti nokuita zvidonaka muvhare miromo yomadzemwa yasingazive <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Raramai sevanhu vadosununguka, asi musingashandise kusununguka kwenyu senzira yokuhwanda nayo kuita zvidoipa, asi raramai sevaranda vaMwari. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Remekedzai vanhu vese. Idai hama dzinotenda, ichai Mwari, remekedzai mambo.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muenzaniso Wokutambudzika kwaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Varanda zviisei pasi paatenzi venyu norukudzo rese, aikona kunovaye vadonaka novadopfava vega, asiwo nokunovaye vanoukari. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ndava zvinopembedzewa kana munhu akatsunga kudzimbiwa zvisinai kodzero nondava yokuti anoziva Mwari. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Asi ungarumbidzihwei kana ukadzonga worovehwa kuphonyako unotochiiriraba? Manje pamunoita zvidonaka motambudziwa pamusaka pazvene chiirirai pazviri, munopembedzewa pamberi paMwari. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Zvakarezvi ndizvo zvamudodaidzihwa, ndava Khirisitu adokutambudzikirai, achikusiirai muenzaniso, kuti mutevere tsoka dzache. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Hapanai chitema chaadoita, futi hapanai kunyengedza kudowanika pamuromo wache. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Pavadomunyomba, haanai kudzotsera, paaitambudziwa haanai kuchichidzira. Asi adovimba naiye anotonga zvidokodzera. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Iye pachake adotakura zvitema zvedu mumuiri wache pamuchinjikwa, kuitira kuti tipfe kuzvitema tiraramire kururama, nomavanga yache mudoporesewa. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ndava manga mudotaika kunge hwai, asi manje madzokera kuna Nyakabusa noMutariri womweya yenyu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Varume noMadzimai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Saizvozvo imipa madzimai zviisei pasi povarume venyu, kuitira kuti vamwe, kana zvavo vasingatetekere shoko, vadzohwe nomuitiro womadzimai yavo pasinai shoko rarehwa, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />kana vachiona muitiro wenyu udochena nokuremekedzeka kwenyu. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Runako renyu mbarireke kuva romucheno wokunze, wokurukha vhudzi nokukochekera mikufu yondarama nombacha dzinoyevedza, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />asi mbarive runako ridohwanda risingapere romunhu womukati rokupfava nomweya udodiha, ridokosha kuna Mwari. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ndava yakarei ndiyo nzira yavaizvipasa runako nayo vakadzi vatsvene vokare vanga vano tariro muna Mwari. Vaizviisa pasi povarume vavo chaivo, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />kunge Sara, waitetekera Abhurahamu achimudaidza kuti tenzi wache. Muri vanasikana vache kana muchiita zvidokohoroka musinai chamunobvumira kuti chikuchisei.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Nonzira ibodzibodziyo varume nzvitsitsai vakadzi venyu, muvabate norukudzo semabiyenyu asinai simba wamunoja naye nhaka yochipo choupenyu hwomutsa, kuitira kuti minamato yenyu ireke kutadzisiwa.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutambudzika Nokuda Kwokuita Zvidonaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Pakupedzisira, mese ivai nomweya wokuwirirana, itiranai tsitsi, mudanane muchiitirana mwoyo munyoro muchiyamurana nokuzvininipisa. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Rekai kutsiidza chidoipa nochidoipa kana kutukana nokutukana, asi panzvimbo yokutsiidza ropafadzai, nokuti zvakarezvi ndizvo zvamudodaidzihwa kuitira kuti mugare nhaka yomaropafadzo. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ndava</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Wese anoda upenyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">nokuona mazuva yadonaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">anofanira kuchengeta chirimi chache kubva pazvidoipa nomuromo wache</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">kubva pakunyaira zvinonyengera.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Anofanira kubirika pazvidoipa achiita zvidonaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">anofanira kutsvaga runyararo nokuritevera.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ndava meso yaIshe yari pano vadorurama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">nonzeve dzache dzidotetekera kuminamato yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">asi Ishe vanoperekera gotsi vanoita zvidoipa.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Mbani angakuhwadzisei kana muchishingairira kuita zvidonaka? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Kana nepo muchifanira kutambudzikira zvidorurama, mudokomborehwa. Rekai kucha kuvhundutsira kwavo, rekai kucha zvavanocha, rekai kuvhundutsiwa navo, <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />asi remekedzai Khirisitu saIshe mumwoyo menyu. Mugare mudogadzirira kupasa mhinduro kunowese anokubvunzai chikonzero chotariro yamunayo. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Asi zvakarezvi zviitei nokupfava norukudzo. Chengetai hana idochena kuitira kuti vanonyaira vachinyomba muitiro wenyu udonaka muna Khirisitu vanyare nomakuhwa yavo. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Kana kuri kuda kwaMwari hasa kuti mutambudzikire kuita zvidonaka panokuti mutambudzikire kuita zvidoipa. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Ndava Khirisitu adopfira zvitema kabodzi zvichibva zvakwana, adorurama panzvimbo yovasinai kururama, kuti akuisei kuna Mwari. Adobaiwa panyama asi adoraramisiwa muMweya, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />wabva kuitiwa mupenyu mumweya adoenda koparidzira mweya iri mutorongo, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />isinai kuteerera Mwari kare paadomirira nomwoyo murefu pamazuva yaNowa panga pachivakhiwa ngarava. Mairi vanhu vashoma vanokwana vasere basi ndivo vadoponesewa nomvura. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Mvura yakarei inosurudzira ruombeko rinokuponesaiwo zvino, kusiri kubisiwa tsambwa yomuviri asi kuruvira hana idochena kuna Mwari. Rinokuponesai kuburikidza nokumuka kwaJesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />uyo adoenda kudenga futi ari kujanja roruji raMwari. Ngirozi, vakuru nomasimba zvidoisiwa pasi pache.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Upenyu Hudosanduhwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Sezvo Khirisitu adotambudzika mumuviri wache, naimipawo zvigadzirirei kuva nopfungwa dzakaredzo, ndava wese watambudzika mumuviri warekera chitema, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />zvoita kuti, muupenyu hwache hwese ararame mukuda kwaMwari, areke kudzorarama muzvido zvidoipa zvonyama. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ndava nguwa idokwana yamaiita zvinodiwa novasiri vatendi uye idodarika kare pamairarama muundururani, kuchiva, kuredzera, mapira, kufumuka, nokushopera kunosemesa. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Vanoshamisika kuti hamubatane navo pakusazvibata kwavo, vobva vakunyombai, <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />asi vachazvidairira kuna iye adogadzirira kutonga vapenyu novadopfa. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Chakarechi ndicho chikonzero vhangeri ridoparidziwa kuno vadopfa, kuitira kuti kana vatongewa nonzira yovanhu vari mumuviri, asi vararame mumweya kunge Mwari.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vachengeti Vadonaka Vozvipo zvaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Kuguma kwozvinhu zvese kwava papfupi, nokudaro ivai nopfungwa dzidojeka muchizvidzora kuti mugone kunamata. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Pamusoro pozvese, dananai zvidokungudza, sezvo rudo runofukidza zvitadzo zvizinji. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Tambiranai pasinai kunyunyutirana. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Munhu wese mbaashandise chipo chaadotambira kuti ashumire vamwe nacho, sevachengeti vadotendeka vomarudzi mazinji yomutsa waMwari. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Wese anonyaira mbaaite searikunyaira mashoko yaMwari. Wese anoshumira, mbaaite nosimba rinopasiwa naMwari, kuitira kuti pazvinhu zvese Mwari arumbidziwe kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu. Kwaari mbakuve nokubhwinya nomasimba nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutambudzika semuKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Hama dzinodiwa, musashamisike nomiyedzo inohwadza, irikuuya kwamuri kudzokuedzai, sekunge chinhu chisingazikane chiri kuitika kwamuri. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Asi farai kuti muri kutora chikamu chomatambudziko yaKhirisitu, kuitira kuti mudzosokoka kufara kana kubhwinya kwache kuchiratidziwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Kana muchitukaniwa nokuda kwozita raKhirisitu, mudokomborehwa, ndava Mweya wokubhwinya nowaMwari uri pamuri. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Kutambudzika kwenyu, mbakureke kuva kwochikonzero choumhondi kana choumbavha kana chokupara umwe murandu kana kuva nomungu. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Zvisinei, kana uchitambudzika semuKhirisitu, reka kunyara, asi rumbidza Mwari kuti unozita rakarero.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ndava yava nguwa yokuti kutonga kuthangire mumhuri yaMwari, uye kana kuchithanga naisisu, ko kuno vasingateerere Vhangeri raMwari zvichagumira poi? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Uye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Kana zvidoomera adorurama kuti aponesewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">ko kudzoti mutadzi novasinganamate vachaoneka poi?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Saka vanotambudzika zviri maererano nokuda kwaMwari vanofanira kuzvikumikidza kuMusiki wavo adotendeka voramba vachiita zvidonaka.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Boka raMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Ndinokumbira vakuru vari pakati penyu, semukuru biyavo, ndiriwo pfakazi yokutambudzika kwaKhirisitu nouyo achakovehwa kubhwinya kucharatidziwa. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Risai boka raMwari riri pasi penyu. Itai zvakarezvo aikona nokusukumidziwa, asi nokuti munoda, sezvinodiwa naMwari kuti muite, musingaitire nhafu yokuda mari, asi chido chokushumira. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Musingaremedze vamunotungamira, asi muve mienzaniso kuboka. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Uye pachaonekwa Nyakabusa Mukuru muchatambira korona yokubhwinya isingaumbuke.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Saizvozvowo imipa vadiki nonzira ibodzibodziyo zviisei pasi povakuru. Mese zvenyu zvisimidzei kuzvininipisa, umwe kuno umwe, nokuti, “Mwari anopikisana novanozvikudza, asi anopasa mutsa kuno vanozvininipisa.” <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Saka zvininipisei, pasi pojanja raMwari romasimba, kuti akusumudzirei panguwa idofanira. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Thurirai paari kunetseka kwenyu kwese ndava iye anohanya naimimi.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Ivai vadopengenuka mungwarire! Muvengi wenyu jabhurosi anofamba achidzvova kunge mhondoro inotsvaga waingaje. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Murambidzei, mudomira zvidosimba pakutenda, ndava munoziva kuti kutambudzika kudodaroko kuri kuitikawo kuhama dzenyu dziri pasi pese. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Uye mumasure mokushupika kwonguwa ipfupi, Mwari wonyasha adokudaidzirai kubhwinya kwache kusingapere, iye pachake achakudzoreredzai, akutsigirei nokukusimbisai. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Kwaari mbakuve nomasimba nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoresa Kwokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Ndanyora tsamba rakareri ripfupi ndichibatsihwa naSirivhanasi, hama yandinoti idotendeka, kuti ndikukurudzirei uye ndipase upfakazi kuti uyu mutsa waMwari pachokwadi, mirai mudosimba mauri.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Kherekhe iri kuBhabhironi, idosarudziwa pabodzi naimimi, yati tikumoresei, ndomwenze naMariko kamu mwanakomana wangu. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Moresanai nokutsvoda kworudo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Rugare kwamuri mese muri muna Khirisitu.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>